# E00 Agents2: sequential in a random order drawn from the seed of the oracle (D96), so the C# fixes the order of every
# line (exact trace, level (a)): the messages each agent prints, in sequence.
cover all
fact message ^\[(agent\d) -> (agent\d)\]: (.*)$
same message seq
check message count == 22
fact error (Exception|out of range)
optional error
check error count == 0
